<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Sunday's match:</p>
<p>21 - Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>20 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>17 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool)</p>
<p>16 - Dwight Yorke (Aston Villa)</p>
<p>14 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough), Ole Gunnar</p>
<p>Solskjaer (Manchester United), Michael Evans</p>
<p>(Southampton, 12 for Plymouth)</p>
<p>13 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle)</p>
<p>12 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton)</p>
</text>
